<description>&lt;p&gt;ELN guerrillas used an armed drone to kill a Colombian soldier in Cauca, and the Colombian Air Force later bombed an ELN guerrilla camp, killing at least three combatants. FARC guerrillas are also operating armed drones, expanding the use of unmanned weapons in the conflict. The United Nations has urged De la Espriella to uphold the 2016 peace agreement, while Russian forces struck a deployment hub in Ukraine used by Colombian mercenaries, linking the crisis to external actors. 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168580&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;| Associated Press Of Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQSnRzanBEMm00MFJEeFRSc3ppQllIdFp0NE1sTlRPRDdRQ1hKb2xzRVlycVhROFhHOUlUbmJiejZHc2I0WENUeThWN29YWG1DeG94dE1qWXYwa0FtbjEzR3FXeTNmY1lMTENvX01qbGVWY2tOdTlFNkp1N3lQc0U5aHhCcnMzMEpzQk8tbnZOSkJDNEloUDRmQkRrNWdTWURWNXpmZTFIM1VXTWxnNGZVSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOZ3pOazJ3ZVd1VmNoV2RNakxad28xeW1qUXo1TU9hRU9iTUI4V19DblFUaXFJT1k1UGY3NUItZTNCUk1SZHRtOVJIYWtXQlpFMEpmWnd3dUFWa3AxYlhSa3VtOENKVUJjZHpGVDhzT1VFd3llaWFteFYtRmM3Qk5xMmIxeW1VSUFMQV9nZmZGWGNLSUlXOVlJUkpQSWlHRndJN3JId3NJaVRjVnVq?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Taiwan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPd3o2bUJyeVpDaTV6LUV1ZlU5ZC14aUp4bUx0dEQ5SGxWQllRRHQyTjYzMzZFZGxsTVowXzRfR2FsSm12cHlUSWpFOS1vTlFTNFlrQ3dWbS1aMFdzUG80S3Z1V2JSX2EzZ0NyVnNxSnNMTmc1ZmNEaURUMldYb1VpUGdvb1RuU0V6aDd5eU4talg3eXkyVmpPekdLNXJVdzg3Ym9hU2c0QkU1bmps?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;